=== Windows Build Error Log ===
Date: 2026-02-19

--- Bug #1: npm install broken by PowerShell stderr trap ---
File: build/scripts/windows/build-windows.ps1:560,1222
Fix: Wrap `npm install` with `cmd /c` to isolate stderr from PowerShell error pipeline
Commit: eb12afd079

--- Bug #2: WSL bash instead of Git Bash ---
File: build/scripts/windows/build-windows.ps1:841 (new block)
Symptom: pnpm canvas:a2ui:bundle calls `bash scripts/bundle-a2ui.sh`,
         but `bash` resolves to WSL bash which has no node in PATH
         Error: "exec: node: not found"
Fix: Prepend C:\Program Files\Git\bin to PATH before running pnpm build:secure
Commit: aed856bf7d

--- Bug #3: `|| true` not recognized on Windows cmd.exe ---
File: package.json:44 (build:cn-compile script)
Symptom: `tsc -p tsconfig.cn-encrypt.json || true` fails because cmd.exe
         doesn't know `true` as a command
         Error: "'true' is not recognized as an internal or external command"
Fix: Replace `|| true` with `|| exit 0` (works on both bash and cmd.exe)
Commit: 00f6019479

--- Bug #4: bytenode verification stderr causes PowerShell error ---
File: build/scripts/windows/build-windows.ps1:1286
Symptom: node.exe emits "(node:PID) Warning: Accessing non-existent property
         'autoDiscover'" to stderr. PowerShell ErrorActionPreference=Stop treats
         this as a terminating error, aborting the build.
Fix: Temporarily set ErrorActionPreference=Continue around the bytenode test call
Commit: 7f6a5407dd

--- Bug #5: Missing docs-cn/reference/templates directory ---
File: build/scripts/windows/build-windows.ps1:1433, scripts/windows/setup.iss:62
Symptom: build-windows.ps1 step 5 "Verifying required files" fails because
         docs-cn/reference/templates does not exist. This directory was a
         git submodule that was removed in commit bfa76df69f but setup.iss
         still references it.
Fix: Created docs-cn/reference/templates/.gitkeep locally (matching remote builder)
Note: This directory should be committed to the repo to prevent future issues

=== Proactive Audit: Same-class bugs in other Windows scripts ===

--- Bug #6: dev-gateway.ps1 unprotected pnpm/node stderr (2 calls) ---
File: scripts/windows/dev-gateway.ps1:53,65
Symptom: `& pnpm exec` and `& node --import tsx` calls run under
         ErrorActionPreference=Stop. Any stderr output (deprecation
         warnings, TS experimental features) can abort the script.
Fix: Wrap both calls with ErrorActionPreference=Continue guard

--- Bug #7: dev-deploy.ps1 unprotected npm call ---
File: scripts/windows/dev-deploy.ps1:33
Symptom: `& npm run build` under ErrorActionPreference=Stop. npm
         stderr warnings abort before $LASTEXITCODE check.
Fix: Wrap with cmd /c + ErrorActionPreference=Continue guard

--- Bug #8: rebuild-and-fix.ps1 unprotected pnpm calls (2 calls) ---
File: scripts/windows/rebuild-and-fix.ps1:47,62
Symptom: `& pnpm rebuild` and `& pnpm build` under
         ErrorActionPreference=Stop. Native module rebuild warnings
         and TS build stderr can abort the script.
Fix: Wrap both with ErrorActionPreference=Continue guard + explicit exit code check

--- Bug #9: setup.iss patches without skipifsourcedoesntexist ---
File: scripts/windows/setup.iss:86
Symptom: `Source: "..\..\patches\*"` has no skipifsourcedoesntexist flag.
         If patches directory is missing, Inno Setup compilation fails.
Fix: Added skipifsourcedoesntexist flag for defensive build

